#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:448
msgid ""
"Nix supports per-user **configuration**, **state**, and **cache** "
"directories. The following environment variables override the locations for "
"these directories:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:451
msgid ""
"\\[user configuration directory\\]{#user-conf-dir}: \\[`NIX_CONFIG_HOME`\\]"
"{#env-NIX_CONFIG_HOME}"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:452
msgid "user state directory: \\[`NIX_STATE_HOME`\\]{#env-NIX_STATE_HOME}"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:453
msgid "user cache directory: \\[`NIX_CACHE_HOME`\\]{#env-NIX_CACHE_HOME}"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:455
msgid "When these are not set, the defaults depend on the platform:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:457
msgid ""
"On Unix, the [XDG base directories](#xdg-base-directories): "
"`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/nix`, `$XDG_STATE_HOME/nix`, `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/nix`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:458
msgid ""
"On Windows, the [Windows Known Folders](#known-folders): `%APPDATA%"
"\\nix\\config`, `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\nix\\state`, `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\nix\\cache`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:462
msgid ""
"For backwards compatibility, legacy Nix commands (e.g. `nix-env`, `nix-"
"channel`) use dotfiles in `$HOME` instead of these directories unless [`use-"
"xdg-base-directories`](../../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-use-xdg-base-"
"directories) is enabled. [New Nix commands](../../command-ref/new-cli/nix."
"md) (experimental) use the proper directories by default."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:465
msgid ""
"When [`use-xdg-base-directories`](../../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-use-"
"xdg-base-directories) is enabled, the configuration directory is resolved as:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:467
msgid "`$NIX_CONFIG_HOME`, if it is defined"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:468
msgid "Otherwise, the platform default (e.g. `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/nix` on Unix)"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-env/set-flag.md:470
msgid "Likewise for the state and cache directories."
msgstr ""

